WEBVTT

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.250
What? A high school student?

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.290
Um...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:14.910
Chiyuki told me you were a Geika student.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.870
You lied to me, Chiyuki.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:25.000
Sorry, Tsumura. I have to
take back what I just said.

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:28.660
I understand.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:29.950
Chiyuki.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:32.450
I don't want this to go to your head.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:36.040
Don't forget you're only here
because of Tsumura.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.330
You can't keep disrespecting others like this.

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:42.160
You don't have talent. Let that sink in.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:45.080
--This is awkward... He's being too harsh.
--I'm going to suspend you for a while.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:46.870
--Huh?
--Do you understand?

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.000
Yes.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.870
A-Actually!

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:54.330
I'm the one who asked her.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:57.750
I didn't want anyone to know
I was making clothes.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:00.040
I never wanted to be a designer anyway.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:02.790
It's really not a big deal.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.250
"Smile Down the Runway"

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:37.910
"Pre-School"

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:41.580
"Pre-School"
"Episode 2"
"A Professional's World"
Ichika! Your brother's here for you!

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.620
Thank you very much.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:47.080
Iku, Ichika's a princess!

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:48.250
A princess?

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:51.790
Ichika's going to play Cinderella
in our next play!

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:53.830
Really? So that means...

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:57.330
Yes! Would you mind being
our costume designer again?

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:00.160
I'd love to!

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.200
Goodbye!

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.620
Bye-bye.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.370
Ikuto's such a loving brother.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.910
He's the one who holds down the fort.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:14.080
I don't have to be a designer

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.790
to make clothes.

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:18.040
I'm going to try again.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:18.870
What...?

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:21.750
I'm going to ask my dad again!

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.410
To hire you as a designer!

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:26.290
I beg you, please don't.

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:29.660
If you don't act now, nothing's going to change.

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:31.830
It's your dream, isn't it?

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:33.370
To become a fashion designer?

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:39.950
I enjoy making clothes.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.410
Every time I make clothes for someone,

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:44.620
they're filled with joy.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:50.120
As long as they're there,
I'll be content. That's how I feel.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.950
So I'm okay.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:56.250
I don't need to be a designer.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.620
I see.

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:59.620
In that case, take this.

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:01.910
But this is...

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:04.290
I don't want it anymore. See ya.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:05.120
What?

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:08.200
Wait! You should keep it!

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:12.700
I have no interest in wearing
a no-name designer.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.120
Bye.

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:17.700
Frustrating...

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:19.830
This is so frustrating...

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:23.000
Don't move another inch!

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:23.830
What?

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:25.870
Miss Fujito, how selfish are you?

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.750
I made it at your request,

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.290
and now you don't want it? Seriously?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.040
Hey... T-Tsumura...

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:35.120
You're the one who got me
involved with your lies!

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.830
And this is how you treat me now?

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.540
Acting like I'm the one to blame!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.660
So close!

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.250
I-I'm sorry!

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.750
I do feel bad.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:54.000
I know I'm being selfish.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.290
But I just don't want you to give up.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:05:01.370
I want to prove myself wrong.
That it's possible.

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:05.200
It's possible for me to appear
in Paris Fashion Week...

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:09.250
It's possible for you to become a designer...

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:11.660
I want to prove it for myself, too.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:25.290
What is it?

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:26.790
What are you doing?

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:29.750
Clothes can transform a person.

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:32.450
That's one of the reasons
I enjoy making clothes.

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:37.830
Facing President Fujito again is terrifying.

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:42.660
But I'll make something that'll transform
that doom into courage.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:46.450
If I become a professional,
will you wear my clothes again?

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:48.250
Yes.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:52.910
Excuse me.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.410
Mr. Tsumura is here to see you.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.500
Have him come in.

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.290
Oh...

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:12.540
Did you design that outfit yourself?

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:13.910
Yes.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:17.290
I don't know anything about modeling...

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:22.040
All I know is that when I saw
Miss Chiyuki wear my clothes...

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.950
...I saw a person transform my clothes.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.790
I'm only here because Miss Chiyuki's photo

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:33.750
went viral after it caught
the attention of a famous model.

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:37.870
If it was anyone else wearing my clothes,
I wouldn't be here right now!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.540
That's why... I have no doubt!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:45.200
Miss Chiyuki will become an amazing model!

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.200
I'm sorry for getting carried away...

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.500
You came here just to tell me that?

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:01.910
Oh... And...

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:06.290
...to ask if Mille Neige would hire me...

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:09.040
I see.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:12.700
We can't hire you because you're
a high school student.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:18.700
To be honest, I was shocked to see
such quality from a high school student.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.450
You've got potential, that's for sure.

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:27.080
But you lack the necessary
knowledge and experience.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:32.080
But... coming back here after you were
rejected shows true determination.

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:34.950
What do you think, Tsumura?

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:39.750
A designer who recently left us
to start his own business called earlier.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:44.410
He's looking to hire someone.
Are you interested

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:47.120
in meeting with a professional designer?

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:55.080
So why did I have to bring you to this place?

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:59.000
Um... I'm sorry...

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.700
So, what did you and Dad talk about yesterday?

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:02.700
Huh?

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.870
I can never tell you!

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:09.790
What?

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.830
I simply asked him if he would hire me...

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:13.830
Liar.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:17.250
Dad wouldn't just cut
my suspension short like that.

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:20.750
So you're not suspended anymore?

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.580
Glad to hear.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.290
So talk.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:28.080
We're here.

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:30.370
This is the studio...?

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:32.450
It's a residential building.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:35.870
All designers start out like this.

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:36.790
But...

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:42.540
Even before he became independent,
Hajime Yanagida won prestigious prizes

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:45.620
and was sought after by celebrities.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:48.620
He's not just some up-and-coming designer.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:53.330
But brace yourself.
He's got the worst personality!

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:54.540
Noted.

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:58.950
But this is going to be good
for you, Tsumura. Probably.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:01.040
Well, my job here is done. See ya.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:04.080
O-Okay. Thanks so much.

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.830
Well, you know...

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.580
I'm going to try my best.

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:13.950
So you better, too.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.330
Thanks...

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.830
Um... For wha--?

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.120
Shut up! See ya!

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:34.160
No answer...

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:39.000
Excuse me...

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.830
Hey, you. What are you doing?

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.040
Come on in.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.910
Oh? Um, okay?

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:46.830
I-It's very nice to meet you.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:50.330
Hey, get a needle and thread.

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:51.830
So beautiful...

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.790
Don't just stand there.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.700
See that? Use those right there.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:56.700
Hurry up!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:58.200
O-Okay!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.160
Sew this as instructed.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:02.870
What? W-Wait a minute.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.040
You want me to sew it? Directly?

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.200
Huh? What are you doing here?

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.330
Aren't you here to work?

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:13.330
It's time to get serious.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:14.540
Yes, I am.

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:17.750
Blind stitch them together 2 cm from the hem.

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.540
Keep the seam inconspicuous.

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:22.540
Prick me and you're dead.

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:23.500
Yes!

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:32.250
I'm done.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.540
All right. Come over here.

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:36.750
Yes.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.200
I'm Hajime Yanagida.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:40.370
I-I'm Ikuto Tsumura.

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:41.700
So, Bob.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:42.540
B--?

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:44.160
Any questions so far?

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:46.910
Um... Are you a man?

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:47.750
What?

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.160
I'm sorry.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:51.450
Oh, this outfit?

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:52.660
It's not for me.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:55.580
I'm wearing it as a final check.

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:59.950
I became independent this year,
but my company was established a while ago.

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:03.700
It's an online business, predominantly.

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:05.750
What else is there to explain?

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:07.330
Amazing...

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:10.040
I'm... I'm going to do my best, thank you for--

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:12.950
Oh, stop. That's not necessary.

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:16.160
So... Where are the other workers?

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:18.620
What do you mean? They're right there.

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:19.620
What...?

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.410
Excuse me, are you okay?!

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.700
What? Are my two hours up already?

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.790
They're up. Now back to work.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:30.790
Okay...

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.620
We don't have much time.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:36.790
We still have a ton of things left to do.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:38.290
Finish them or die.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:39.540
But...

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:41.330
Iida, it's time to wake up.

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.950
I can't...

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.160
I'll help, too!

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.910
Not so fast, Bob.

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:49.330
Bob?

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:51.620
You did this, right?

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:53.330
According to that geezer Fujito,

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:57.000
this kid is a genius whose work
was featured in magazines.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.450
Take a look at his handiwork.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:03.040
Thanks for coming to the Hazime Yanagida studio.

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.580
Yes! Thank you very--

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:11.580
And goodbye.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:16.870
"Smile down the runway."

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:19.250
But why...?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:24.500
I ordered you to blind stitch it
so the seams won't show.

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:28.660
You gave me a regular blind stitch
that only conceals the seams on the front.

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:33.250
I wanted a blind stitch that conceals
the seams on both sides.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:36.120
Did you not learn anything at school?!

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:39.040
For the wearer, the back
is as important as the front.

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.330
Unbelievable.

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:41.950
I'm sorry.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:44.580
I'm self-taught,

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:46.250
and I'm still 17, so...

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.000
A high school student?

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.120
You're just a damn brat!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:53.450
That geezer... He didn't tell me on purpose!

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:58.160
Is this a joke? Does he think this is funny?

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:03.540
Ah, the model wearing your outfit
was the geezer's daughter, right?

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:07.000
Both model and designer are mediocre at best.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:10.330
That geezer's spoiling his daughter rott--

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:12.330
Miss Fujito isn't like that!

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:14.330
Well, what do I care?

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:15.950
I don't have time for this.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:17.870
You're useless to me.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:19.330
Go home.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:23.500
I'm very sorry.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.120
Are you interested

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:30.120
--I was given many chances.
--in meeting with a professional designer?

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:30.620
--I want to prove that it's possible
for you to become a designer.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:34.080
--Yet again...
--I want to prove that it's possible
for you to become a designer.

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:47.250
I'm going to try my best.

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:48.700
So you better, too.

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:55.620
Will you let me fix it?

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:58.870
I don't need your help. Get out.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:01.040
I'm not going anywhere.

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:05.540
Leave!

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:06.580
No!

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:09.330
I can't afford to hire an amateur!

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:10.700
I beg you, please!

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:14.290
Will you at least let me fix that dress?

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:15.660
Please!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.950
Such a pain... Whatever, suit yourself.

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:23.700
Thank you so much!

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:32.410
I have no idea how I'm
supposed to cut the fabric!

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:36.950
The hem's destroyed but the shape is the same--

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:40.160
so you can trace this to get the pattern.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:42.000
Thank you so much!

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:48.120
Moriyama. Get this one ready for tomorrow.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:49.410
I did it!

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:53.040
It's nothing to be proud of.
I wouldn't get on that high horse yet.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:55.160
Hey, the door's over there.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.290
Go home.

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:02.120
I refuse.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:05.660
I want to become a designer.

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:08.830
But I don't have the skills or the experience.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:12.950
So if I give up now, I'll never be one!

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:14.540
This is my only chance.

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:17.830
Please let me help you, Mr. Yanagida.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.410
You're sure?

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:23.790
Yes! I'm ready--

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:25.660
Just know...

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:29.160
We call kids like you "wannabes."

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:32.120
You'll never make it.

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:34.540
Don't let him get to you.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:37.080
He's just uptight because tomorrow's the show.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.330
The show...?

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:39.750
Japan's premier fashion show.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:46.040
It's every designer's dream
for their brand to be featured there.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:48.790
Tomorrow, we go to Tokyo Fashion Week.

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.660
Wow...

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:54.870
Sorry for making you pull
an impromptu all-nighter last night.

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:57.410
Please don't be. I'm fine.

00:15:57.410 --> 00:16:00.620
Mr. Yanagida is a very talented designer.

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:03.580
He may have a sharp tongue and an ego,

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:07.620
but I'm grateful that I get to work with him.

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:13.200
Fashion professionals from all over
the world are gathered here today.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:13.700
--"Hazime Yanagida is the brand of the future."

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.000
--Hey, Yanagida. How are you?
--"Hazime Yanagida is the brand of the future."

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.750
--Great to see you.
--To get everyone to believe that,
we need to crush this show no matter what.

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:20.700
--I'm looking forward to your show today.
--To get everyone to believe that,
we need to crush this show no matter what.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.290
Thank you very much.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.870
Well, I'll do my best as well--

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:26.410
Hey, Bob!

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:28.160
There's nothing you can do.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:30.000
Just stay quiet.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.120
Yes...

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.080
I'm so sorry!

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:38.250
It's so crowded--

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:39.450
You're late!

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:41.950
--Ouch...
--You do realize you represent

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:44.790
Japan's premier high fashion
magazine, "MODE JAPAN"?!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.750
Get a hold of yourself.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.120
But...

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:50.790
And what are you wearing right now?

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:55.120
You told me I should wear
the best clothes I have.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:56.120
They're ugly.

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:59.080
Well, what do you expect?

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:03.200
I wanted to work in literature--
I know nothing about fashion!

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.790
Thank you for waiting!

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.250
Please enter in order.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:11.370
Pay close attention to "Hazime Yanagida."

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:15.620
The talk is that it could be
the brand of the future.

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:19.410
Well... Only if this show
turns out to be a success.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.660
Hey! What's taking them so long?!

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:25.040
They'll arrive shortly.

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.040
We're out of time here!

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.160
I know that!

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:30.910
--Damn it.
--What's going on?

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:33.330
Shut up! Don't talk to me right now.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.580
There's been a mishap.

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:41.330
One of the models couldn't make it.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:46.160
So Yanagida had to quickly arrange for
a replacement through an acquaintance.

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:48.870
The model's not here?

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:50.750
I apologize it took so long.

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:55.950
I'm Chiyuki Fujito from Mille Neige.

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:57.750
Thank you for having me.

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.830
Is this some kind of joke...?

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:04.370
You gotta be kidding me, geezer!

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:07.700
He knows how crucial this show is!

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:10.290
--Am I supposed to be laughing right now?!

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:13.290
--Mr. Yanagida, please calm down.
--Am I supposed to be laughing right now?!

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:16.580
--Mr. Yanagida!
--Sending you down the runway
is a surefire way to ruin the sho--

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:18.040
Please!

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:22.040
Give me a chance.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:24.500
Miss Fujito...

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:29.830
We'll show the 40 dresses
without our last model.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.870
We're re-arranging the whole program.

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:33.580
Models, follow me!

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:35.750
Miss Fujito.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:36.870
Go away.

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:38.700
I'm fine.

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:43.500
I know more than anyone that I don't
have the right to be here right now.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:45.450
But I'm still doing it.

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:48.620
Because this is my chance.

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:50.000
It's not going to work.

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:53.750
No matter how we arrange it,
we won't be able to show the last dress.

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.580
Make it work!

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:59.080
Do you really want that shorty
to ruin the whole show?

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:01.160
How about we lose a dress?

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:04.330
No. The audience is expecting 40.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:05.830
Then...

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:11.410
Chiyuki Fujito.

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:14.330
Prepare yourself for the worst.

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.870
I spent the last six months working

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:19.870
to make this show a success.

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:25.660
Everyone here is doing their part
to make my show a success.

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.000
Bear it!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:30.700
Bear the responsibility that this
show's success depends on you!

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:35.620
As if I didn't know that already.

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:36.750
Moriyama!

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:39.870
Tailor dress #17 to fit the shorty.

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:40.950
Okay!

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:43.330
Bob, help me out.

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:47.370
Darn it. I knew I should've
had Iida come with me.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.500
He did seem ill, though.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.540
Are you okay, Miss Moriyama?

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:53.200
I'm fine.

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:55.120
Could you change into this?

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:58.830
Sorry. I was in a hurry,
so I still have my bra on.

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:03.160
Miss Fujito! What are you--?!

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.660
I'm posting the revised timetable here!

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:11.750
We're on in 20 minutes!

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:13.910
Models and fitters, note the changes.

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:17.750
Models change multiple times during a show.

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:20.700
Each outfit is unique with
different levels of exposure.

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:22.620
Every second counts during a show.

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:25.660
There's no time to change underwear.

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:29.120
Nobody's watching.
This is a professional workplace.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:33.750
Everyone knows models wear "nude."

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:36.290
Got it, Tsumura?

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:37.700
Y-Yes...

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:39.450
I'll do my best.

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:41.700
"DOOM..."

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:44.500
This is worse than I thought.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:46.830
It was made for a 180 cm model,

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:49.500
so this was to be expected...

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:52.870
But I'm impressed, the waist fits perfectly.

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:55.410
Your body is model-ready.

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:58.000
You can't do this eating two meals a day.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:59.500
You're working hard.

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:01.540
You're a great model.

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:03.700
I need the fitter to get the heels ready!

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.870
Number one through number twelve are new.

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:07.450
Get me the smallest size!

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:08.750
Right away.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:11.950
Now, I've been trying to figure this out...

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:15.540
Shoot... The fabric's too
thick to alter the length.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:16.500
Do I cut it?

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:20.330
No, fixing the hem would be
too much of a hassle.

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:21.620
Fifteen more minutes...

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:23.450
What's the fix...? What's the fix...?

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:25.540
I need to know now!

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.750
Bob!

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:28.080
Yes!

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:32.950
Miss Moriyama... Your nose is bleeding...

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:33.870
What...?

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:34.700
A-Are you okay?!

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:36.660
Chiyuki, don't move an inch!

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:41.370
If you get any blood on yourself,
you'll ruin Mr. Yanagida's dress!

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:44.660
--What's going on?
--Moriyama's down.

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:45.700
Is she okay?

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:47.250
Get an ambulance, quick!

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:50.410
I knew she wasn't okay...

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:56.700
Wait... This is really bad.

00:21:56.700 --> 00:22:01.290
Mr. Yanagida! I'll call the ambulance,
so please handle the dress...

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:02.250
I'm screwed.

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.450
What?

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:05.700
I said, I'm screwed!

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:08.830
I specialize in design. I don't make clothes.

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:12.790
How could this happen?

00:22:12.790 --> 00:22:17.540
First, a model backs out, and then my
only dressmaker goes out of commission.

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:21.160
What the hell am I supposed to do now?!

00:22:21.160 --> 00:22:24.450
I feel bad for Mr. Yanagida,
but this is my chance.

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:25.950
--Everyone here is doing their part.

00:22:25.950 --> 00:22:27.200
--Don't move an inch!
--Everyone here is doing their part.

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:30.200
If you get any blood on yourself,
you'll ruin Mr. Yanagida's dress!

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:32.830
Sorry, Bob...

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:42.870
I'm leaving the rest to you...

00:22:44.870 --> 00:22:47.580
I'll do it.

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:51.700
Will you let me fix Miss Fujito's dress,

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:53.250
Mr. Yanagida?!

00:24:24.700 --> 00:24:27.000
Can I do this?

00:24:27.000 --> 00:24:28.750
I'll finish it in time!

00:24:28.750 --> 00:24:31.040
So wait for me, Miss Fujito!

00:24:31.040 --> 00:24:33.950
Next, "Smile Down the Runway."

00:24:33.950 --> 00:24:36.950
"See you next time!!"
